                        <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: white;">SmileCare</h3>
                        <p>Premium dental care with modern technology and personalized treatment.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="footer-col">
                        <h4>Quick Links</h4>
                        <ul>
